    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's interesting. you mentioned the \"opportunity cost\" effect and how it might make people choose to disengage. do you think the current level of benefits is actually the main driver behind the recent shifts in participation, or are there other things like automation or demographics that play a bigger role?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
